research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json-31805-          "source": "def-uniform-cover-space",
research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json-31806-          "source_section": "Definition",
research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json:31807:          "quote": "A **uniform-cover structure** is a nonempty family $\\mathfrak C$ of covers of $X$ such that a cover refined by a member of $\\mathfrak C$ belongs to $\\mathfrak C$, any two members have a common refinement in $\\mathfrak C$, and every member has a star-refinement in $\\mathfrak C$. Its members are **uniform covers**. When $X\\ne\\varnothing$, the topology it induces and its equivalence with entourages are proved in [[lem-entourage-and-uniform-cover-dictionary]].",
research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json-31808-          "uses": [
